<title>DUBAI: Oman increases December crude price to $22.82..</title>
<headline>Oman increases December crude price to $22.82..</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oman has hiked the price of its crude lifted in December by $1.02 to $22.82 a barrel, an official at Oman's Ministry of Petroleum and Minerals said on Sunday.</p>
<p>The move follows a decision by Abu Dhabi National Oil Company (ADNOC) on Saturday to increase its official December crude prices by 90 cents to $1.10.</p>
<p>-- Steven Swindells, Dubai Newsroom, +971 4 6071255.</p>
